{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.pentagon_uv_commutation_inter_level_placeholder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.pentagon_uv_commutation_inter_level_placeholder","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/PentagonUvCommutation.lean#L90-L123","doc":"Inter-level pentagon ascension (q-graded). Stated as a\nforward-declaration of the form the inter-level identity should\ntake when `QOU.LiftingDescent.JetProlongation` lands.\n\nThe descent operator `τ̂_n : 𝒜_{n+1} → 𝒜_{n+1}^{desc}` and its\ntransient kernel `B_λ^trans = ker τ̂_n ∩ B_λ` are the right domain\nfor the q-deformed quantum-torus relation. The full theorem will\nassert: for the operator lift `Ũ : B_λ^{(n)}_trans → B_λ^{(n+1)}`,\nthe pair `(Ũ_i Ũ_j, Ũ_k)` satisfies `uv = q · vu` modulo the\ndescended residual `R_q ∈ im τ̂_n`.\n\nUntil JetProlongation lands, we leave the inter-level identity as\na placeholder disjunction including `True` (the descent-residual\ncase is always satisfied trivially when the residual is\nunconstrained). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.hatV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.hatV","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/PentagonUvCommutation.lean#L41-L50","doc":"The Hecke traced-volume operator at generator index i is the\nMarkov-trace value of σ_i in the Wedderburn block B_λ. We model it\nabstractly as the embedded generator gen i ∈ A; downstream theorems\nrestrict to specific blocks via the Wedderburn decomposition. ","signatureChunk":0}]}